{"completed": true, "response": "{\"more_loop\":\"Y\",\"x_loops\":[\"S02-S05：在“当初受的气不该忍”与“从前的好日子、亲近又舍不得”之间反复；不过S03把留恋推进到“被当自己人”，S04推进到“是否走错”，S05推进到争累后的难受，所以虽有摆动仍在加深。\",\"S06-S08：在“想起有人陪伴而觉得暖”与“想到以后独自扛难处而发慌”之间来回；S08重复了S06-S07的暖→怕，但新增了“回忆没法陪着他”这一层，因此不算完全回到原处。\"],\"y_loops\":[\"S02-S05：同样在“委屈不能忍”与“从前的好、亲近舍不得”之间连续摆动；虽有从留恋到后悔疑问、再到疲惫难受的推进，但核心冲突多次回到原位。\",\"S06-S08：S06刚经历“亲近回忆带来暖意”，S07又因以后只能独自熬而慌；S08再次只是“想起有人在身边→暖一下→暖意退去、心又悬起来”，几乎重走前两段已经走过的情绪路径，新增内容最少。\",\"S10-S11：又一次回到“舍不得亲近、但委屈拦着不能回”的两端；S11后半才凭“先把现在过下去”真正向前脱离这个摆动。\"],\"why\":\"两条总体结构几乎相同，主要差别在S08：X用“回忆没法陪着他”把前面的暖与怕推进成一个新认识；Y的S08基本只是把S06-S07的“暖一下→又悬起来”再演一遍，因此更像在原地折返。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7ab2b824-d536-4602-80a3-f4437a75d25d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T073030081519Z", "elapsed_seconds": 13.11, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:30:43.201212+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b586ee55b69a6b7abe63aa53fbbaef9a6af906cb60e9519cdfe557b9cab76984", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e